Subject: [PATCH 1/7] MdeModulePkg/UiApp: List the forms of formsets that ask
 for it

The front page has one entry per formset with the front page class GUID.
A setup menu split into categories, one form each, can only be reached
through its first form.

Add the EDKII_IFR_FRONT_PAGE_FORMS_GUID formset class GUID: the front page
lists each form of such a formset, except the first one, as an entry of
its own, with the form title as prompt. Forms with an empty title are
left out, so a formset can declare spare forms and only use some of
them. A package list with several formsets gets the forms of those
with the class GUID, each pointing to its own formset. The entries come
first, followed by an empty line.

